1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-18","period":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/354950/000162828026019436/hd-20260201.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Home Depot, Inc. is the world's largest home improvement retailer based on net sales for fiscal 2025. We offer our customers a wide assortment of home improvement products, building materials, lawn and garden products, d cor products, and facilities MRO products, in stores and online. We also provide a number of services, including home improvement installation services, and tool and equipment rental. As of the end of fiscal 2025, we operated 2,359 stores located throughout the U.S. (including the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico and the territories of the U.S. Virgin Islands and Guam), Canada, and Mexico. The Home Depot stores average approximately 104,000 square feet of enclosed space, with approximately 24,000 additional square feet of outside garden area. We also maintain a network of distribution and fulfillment centers, as well as mobile applications and e-commerce websites in the U","zh":"以 2025 財年淨銷售額計算，The Home Depot, Inc. 是全球最大的家居裝修零售商。我們在商店和網路上為客戶提供各種家居裝修產品、建築材料、草坪和花園產品、裝飾產品以及設施 MRO 產品。我們也提供多項服務，包括家居裝修安裝服務以及工具和設備租賃。截至 2025 財年末，我們在美國（包括波多黎各聯邦以及美屬維京群島和關島領土）、加拿大和墨西哥經營 2,359 家商店。家得寶 (Home Depot) 商店平均擁有約 104,000 平方英尺的封閉空間，還有約 24,000 平方英尺的戶外花園區域。我們也在美國維護分銷和履行中心網路以及行動應用程式和電子商務網站"},{"en":"In fiscal 2024, we acquired SRS, a leading residential specialty trade distribution company across several verticals engaged in the distribution of residential and commercial roofing products and complementary building products, landscape supplies, and swimming pool supplies serving the professional roofer, landscaper, and pool contractor. In fiscal 2025, SRS completed the acquisition of GMS, a leading distributor of specialty building products, including drywall, ceilings, steel framing and other complementary construction products. At the end of fiscal 2025, SRS, which includes GMS, operated over 1,250 locations throughout the U.S. and Canada, most of which have a distribution center, material handling and delivery equipment, and inventory. Following the GMS acquisition, SRS is organized as four different lines of business: roofing and building products, interior and construction produ","zh":"在 2024 財年，我們收購了 SRS，這是一家跨多個垂直領域的領先住宅專業貿易分銷公司，從事住宅和商業屋頂產品以及配套建築產品、景觀用品和游泳池用品的分銷，為專業屋頂工、景觀設計師和泳池承包商提供服務。 2025 財年，SRS 完成了對 GMS 的收購，GMS 是專業建築產品的領先經銷商，包括乾牆、天花板、鋼框架和其他配套建築產品。截至 2025 財年末，SRS（包括 GMS）在美國和加拿大經營 1,250 多個地點，其中大多數設有配送中心、物料搬運和交付設備以及庫存。收購 GMS 後，SRS 分為四個不同的業務部門：屋頂和建築產品、室內和建築產品"},{"en":"Unless otherwise indicated or the context otherwise requires, when we refer to \"The Home Depot,\" \"Home Depot,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\" in this report, we are referring to The Home Depot, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"除非另有說明或上下文另有要求，當我們在本報告中提及「The Home Depot」、「Home Depot」、「本公司」、「我們」或「我們的」時，我們指的是 The Home Depot, Inc. 及其合併子公司。"}],"markets":[{"en":"A typical Home Depot store stocks approximately 30,000 to 40,000 items during the year, including both national brand name and proprietary products, across the following merchandising departments: Appliances, Bath, Building Materials, Electrical, Flooring, Hardware, Indoor Garden, Kitchen & Blinds, Lighting, Lumber, Millwork, Outdoor Garden, Paint, Plumbing, Power, and Storage & Organization. Our online product offerings complement our stores by serving as an extended aisle, and we offer a significantly broader product assortment through our mobile applications and websites, including homedepot.com, our primary website; homedepot.ca and homedepot.com.mx, our websites in Canada and Mexico, respectively; hdsupply.com, our website for our MRO products and related services; our websites for custom window coverings, including blinds.com, justblinds.com and americanblinds.com; constructionreso","zh":"典型的家得寶商店全年庫存約 30,000 至 40,000 種商品，包括全國品牌和專有產品，分佈在以下銷售部門：電器、浴室、建築材料、電氣、地板、五金、室內花園、廚房和百葉窗、照明、木材、木製品、戶外花園、油漆、管道、電力以及儲存和組織。我們的線上產品透過充當延伸通道來補充我們的商店，並且我們透過我們的行動應用程式和網站（包括我們的主要網站 homedepot.com）提供更廣泛的產品種類； homedepot.ca 和 homedepot.com.mx，分別是我們在加拿大和墨西哥的網站； hdsupply.com，我們的 MRO 產品和相關窗簾的網站； americanblinds.com；建築資源"},{"en":"Our merchandising organization delivers product innovation, assortment and value, which reinforces our position as the product authority in home improvement and is one of our distinctive competitive advantages. At the same time, we remain focused on offering the right products at everyday value in our stores and online. The strong strategic relationships that our merchandising organization builds with our vendors position us to deliver on our goals for our customers and offer a compelling business proposition for these market-leading suppliers. As part of our focus on product differentiation, we have formed strategic alliances and exclusive relationships with certain suppliers to market products under a variety of well-recognized brand names. We have also developed relationships with certain suppliers to allow us to offer proprietary products that are comparable to national brands. These","zh":"我們的銷售組織提供產品創新、品種和價值，這鞏固了我們作為家居裝修產品權威的地位，也是我們獨特的競爭優勢之一。同時，我們仍然專注於在我們的商店和網路上提供具有日常價值的合適產品。我們的銷售組織與供應商建立了牢固的策略關係，使我們能夠為客戶實現我們的目標，並為這些市場領先的供應商提供令人信服的業務主張。作為我們關注產品差異化的一部分，我們與某些供應商建立了策略聯盟和獨家關係，以各種知名品牌名稱銷售產品。我們還與某些供應商建立了關係，使我們能夠提供可與國內品牌相媲美的專有產品。這些"}],"customers":[{"en":"We serve two primary customer groups — consumers (including both DIY and DIFM customers) and Pros — and have developed varying approaches to meet their diverse needs:","zh":"我們服務於兩個主要客戶群——消費者（包括 DIY 和 DIFM 客戶）和專業人士——並開發了不同的方法來滿足他們的不同需求："},{"en":"These customers are typically homeowners who purchase products and complete their own projects and installations. Our associates assist these customers both in our stores and through digital resources designed to provide product and project knowledge. We also offer a variety of clinics and workshops to share this knowledge and to build an emotional connection with our DIY customers. As the preferences and behaviors of our DIY customers change, we are continuing to invest in capabilities to better meet their evolving expectations.","zh":"這些客戶通常是購買產品並完成自己的專案和安裝的房主。我們的員工在我們的商店中以及透過旨在提供產品和專案知識的數位資源為這些客戶提供幫助。我們還提供各種診所和研討會來分享這些知識並與我們的 DIY 客戶建立情感聯繫。隨著 DIY 客戶的偏好和行為發生變化，我們將繼續投資能力，以更好地滿足他們不斷變化的期望。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"Primary","val":151966000000,"zh":"主要部門"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":12717000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":164683000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"Product","val":159029000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":5654000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":164683000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"US","val":152170000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":12513000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":164683000000}},"peers":["WMT","LOW","PG","KO","DIS"]}}